        "-            <p><strong>(c)</strong> $X=2$, $P=0.5$, $F=\\operatorname{diag}(0.5,0.5)$, $\\operatorname{chol}(F)=0.7071\\,I$, so $K_1=0.7071\\cos(\\pi/3)=0.3536$ and $K_0=0.7071\\sin(\\pi/3)=0.6124$.</p>",
