        "+            <p><strong>(c)</strong> $X=2$, $P=0.5$, $F=\\operatorname{diag}(0.5,0.5)$, $\\operatorname{chol}(F)=\\tfrac1{\\sqrt2}I\\approx0.7071\\,I$, so $K_1=\\tfrac{\\cos(\\pi/3)}{\\sqrt2}=\\tfrac{\\sqrt2}{4}\\approx0.3536$ and $K_0=\\tfrac{\\sin(\\pi/3)}{\\sqrt2}=\\tfrac{\\sqrt6}{4}\\approx0.6124$.</p>",
